{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 35, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "## Lost in Translation (and Loving It) - My Japan Adventure!\n\nJust back from an incredible trip to Japan, and I'm still buzzing! It’s a country of stunning contrasts – ancient temples nestled beside neon-lit skyscrapers, serene gardens juxtaposed with bustling markets. \n\nMy journey started in Tokyo, a whirlwind of sensory overload. Shibuya Crossing was mesmerizing, and exploring the quirky shops in Harajuku was a blast. I devoured ramen (seriously, the best I've ever had!) and spent hours wandering through the peaceful Meiji Jingu Shrine.\n\nFrom Tokyo, I took a bullet train to Kyoto, the cultural heart of Japan.  Visiting Fushimi Inari Shrine with its thousands of vibrant red torii gates was breathtaking.  I strolled through Gion, hoping to catch a glimpse of a geisha, and participated in a traditional tea ceremony. \n\nThe food was a highlight – fresh sushi, delicate tempura, and delicious matcha everything!  Beyond the sights and tastes, it was the kindness and politeness of the people that truly made the trip special. \n\nJapan is a country that rewards curiosity.  It’s a place where tradition and modernity dance together, creating an experience unlike any other.  I can't wait to go back!\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "##", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "▁Lost", "logprob": -0.002094101160764694}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.1602778285741806}, {"token": "▁Translation", "logprob": -0.0005793085438199341}, {"token": "▁(", "logprob": -0.3133775591850281}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -0.0006926044588908553}, {"token": "▁Loving", "logprob": -0.0002641328901518136}, {"token": "▁It", "logprob": -0.00021836756786797196}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -1.2738220691680908}, {"token": "▁-", "logprob": -0.21086786687374115}, {"token": "▁My", "logprob": -0.332557737827301}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.07450290024280548}, {"token": "▁Adv